+  @param[out] Password  Buffer of MaxChars + 1 characters for the password.
+  @param[in]  MaxChars  Maximum length of the password.
+
+  @retval EFI_SUCCESS  Password holds the password (maybe empty).
+  @retval EFI_ABORTED  The dialog was cancelled.
